# Public address of the site, with no trailing slash. Used to build the absolute link-preview
# (og:image / og:url) addresses in index.html, which WhatsApp, Facebook etc. require.
# Currently the temporary Cloudflare preview tunnel. Change it to the real domain after going live,
# then run `npm run build` again.
VITE_SITE_URL=https://shade-twisted-casio-dangerous.trycloudflare.com
